    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, slow down. You're saying the scanner is actually missing high-risk vulnerabilities? That's a pretty massive claim. If I put that in the summary for the board, they're going to demand a complete replacement of our entire toolset, which is a huge budget hit and a total mess for my team. \n\nAre you absolutely sure about that? It sounds like it could just be a temporary configuration glitch or a localized edge case rather than a systemic failure of the tool itself. Can you double-check that? I don't want to blow up our entire security budget over a false positive or a minor calibration issue.",
